  {
    "id": 6901001090010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝、本当におめでとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6901001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "私も会場で見てたんですけど、\r\n発表の瞬間、思わず大声を出しちゃいましたよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6901001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "今もまだ興奮しちゃってて、\r\n今日はもう眠れそうにありません！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6901001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、はづきさん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "本当によくやった\r\n期待以上の結果を出してくれたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6902001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長も……ありがとうございます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ。私と社長も会場に来てましたけど、\r\nすごかったですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6901001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "優勝したってわかった瞬間、社長が泣いてしまって……\r\nステージをほとんど見れていませんでしたから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6901001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "こ、こら！\r\n彼の前でそういうことを言うな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6902001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "それだけ優勝したのを\r\n喜んでたってことじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6901001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "そ、それはそうだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6902001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長、本当にありがとうございます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……とにかく。もっと礼を言うべき相手、\r\nいや、祝うべき相手がいるんじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6902001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうですね\r\n今日の主役は、他でもない彼女ですから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "なら、私たちのことは気にせず\r\n早く行ってこい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6902001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "彼女のこと、いっぱい\r\n褒めてあげてくださいねー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6901001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい！　もちろんです！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bg": "00002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "015",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090010,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……『W.I.N.G.』、優勝できたんだよね……\r\n嘘みたい……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "嘘なんかじゃないさ。甜花はここまで\r\nたくさん頑張ってきて、すごく成長したんだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あの……プロデューサーさん……\r\nありがとう……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "急に改まって、どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと……プロデューサーさんが\r\n甜花を信じてくれたから……ここまで来れた……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんがいなかったら……\r\nきっと……アイドルにも、なれなかったから……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が甜花を信じてこれたのは\r\n甜花の頑張りがあったからだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nプロデューサーさんは、やっぱり優しいね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……『W.I.N.G.』のステージ……キラキラしてて……\r\n会場は、すごく熱くて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "みんなの気持ち……甜花にぶつかってくるみたいで……\r\nすごかった……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あのステージに立てたのは……\r\nなーちゃんたちのおかげだって思う……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "生まれてからずっと甜花と一緒にいて\r\n励ましてくれてたんだもんな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……なーちゃん、ステージが終わった後……\r\nいつもよりいっぱい甜花のこと、褒めてくれた……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "今まで、自分のことに精一杯で……\r\n全然、気付けなかったけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんは、いつも甜花を見ててくれたんだ……\r\nって思ってたら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんびっくりしてた……\r\n甜花が……いつもと、違う気がするって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは。きっと表情に出てたんだろうな\r\n甜花は最近、すごく頼もしくなってきたからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……なーちゃんも喜んでくれたし……\r\n甜花も、アイドルになれて……本当に良かったなって……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "アイドルじゃない甜花だったら……たくさんの人を\r\n笑顔になんて……できなかったと思う……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今の甜花は、\r\nみんなを笑顔にするアイドルだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……甜花……友達、いなくて……\r\nなーちゃん、友達いっぱいだから……ちょっと、さびしかった",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも、アイドルになって……\r\n千雪さんって、だいじな友達……仲間ができた",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "それに……アイドルになってなかったら……\r\nプロデューサーさんにも、会えなかった……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花も頑張ろうって、変わろうって思ってたけど……\r\nひとりじゃ踏み出せなくて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "何かやろうとしたら……\r\n失敗しちゃうんじゃないかなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんにも、いっぱい助けてもらって……\r\n迷惑、かけちゃったかもだけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……でもそのおかげで……ちょっとだけ……\r\n甜花、自分で歩けてる気がするんだ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "迷惑だなんて思ってないさ\r\n何かあったときに甜花をフォローするのは、俺の役目だしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なにより……甜花がこれだけ\r\n成長してくれたことが、俺は嬉しいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\n甜花……変われたんだよね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ。最初に会ったときとは見違えるくらいに\r\n変わったと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "それでも……まだ今は自信……ないんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090240"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090250,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも……少しだけ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090250"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090260,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんのほうが、やっぱりすごいから……\r\n甜花、隣に立ってていいのかな……って思ってる……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090260"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090270,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "今だったら……自分の気持ちに、自信も持てるんだ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090270"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090280,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そんなふうに、思えるようになったのも……\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげ……です……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090280"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090290,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……ありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺のほうこそ、甜花の成長を見させてくれてありがとう\r\n……でも、これで終わりじゃないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花にはまだまだいいところがあって、\r\nそこを磨けば、もっとすごいアイドルになれるんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090300,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……\r\nにへへ……そうだね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090300"
  },
  {
    "id": 6015001090310,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "これからも、よろしくね……\r\nプロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601500109/6015001090310"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]